204 - Come, Thou Long Expected Jesus
 / 
Key: F
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 204
Topic: Jesus Christ - 

Verse 1:
[Dm/A]Come, [Gm]Thou [Dm/A]long-expected Jesus! [C]Born [C7]to [F/C]set [Am/C]Thy people [C]free,
[Dm/A]From [Gm]our [Dm/A]fears [F/C]and [Gm/D]sins [C]release us, Let [C7]us [F/C]find [Am/C]our rest [Dm/A]in [C]Thee.
[C]Israel's [F]strength [Gm]and [Am]consolation, [F/C]Hope [Gm/Bb]of [Am/C]all [Dm]the [Gm/D]earth [C]Thou [D7]art;
[Dm]Dear [Gm]Desire [F/C]of [Gm/D]every [B7]nation, [Gm]Joy of [C]every [Gm/D]longing [C7/Bb]heart.

Verse 2:
[Dm/A]Born thy [Gm/D]people [C]to [C7]deliver,
[Dm/A]born a [F/C]child [C]and [C7]yet [Am/C]a [Dm/A]King,
[Dm/A]born to [Gm/D]reign [C]in us [C7]forever,
[Dm/A]now thy [F/C]gracious [C7]kingdom [Dm/A]bring.
[C]By [F]thine [Am]own [Gm]eternal [Dm]spirit
[C]rule [Am]in [Gm]all [F/C]our [Am]hearts [Dm]alone;
[Dm]by [C]thine [Gm/D]all [F]sufficient [Bb]merit,
[Dm]raise [C]us [Gm/D]to [B7]thy [Gm]glorious [F/C]throne.
